[46.518938, "o", "6-5338-9a45-fccff83a6194\r\n1844:owner: bwong\r\n1845:signed: false\r\n1846:\r\n1847:#### Amendment for TXN-caf3e53e-08b7-5f87-a4bc-3cc0e10ff87f\r\n1848:owner: evans\r\n1849:signed: true\r\n1850:effective: 2024-11-01\r\n1851:\r\n1852:#### Amendment for TXN-ba9e6ade-67ce-5a61-b097-ab0d34f8e6bb\r\n1853:owner: earlybird\r\n1854:signed: true\r\n1855:effective: 2020-01-01\r\n1856:\r\n1857:## Email Excerpts\r\n1858:\r\n1859:Investigator commentary: only compliance-addressed threads with transaction subjects in this section affect merge logic; surrounding mail establishes timing context.\r\n1860:\r\n1861:From: audit-lead@corp.internal\r\n1862:Subject: FY24 sampling plan draft — thread 0\r\n1863:\r\n1864:Internal coordination on vendor onboarding backlog. No transaction identifiers\r\n1865:appear in this message. Investigators archived it to preserve mailbox ordering\r\n1866:around compliance threads.\r\n1867:\r\n1868:From: hr-payroll@corp.internal\r\n1869:Subject: accrual true-up schedule — thread 1\r\n1870:\r\n1871:Internal coordination on lease modification restate"]
