[46.51896, "o", "o preserve\r\n1894:mailbox ordering around compliance threads.\r\n1895:\r\n1896:From: treasury-ops@corp.internal\r\n1897:Subject: wire desk weekend coverage — thread 5\r\n1898:\r\n1899:Internal coordination on payroll accrual true-up. No transaction identifiers\r\n1900:appear in this message. Investigators archived it to preserve mailbox ordering\r\n1901:around compliance threads.\r\n1902:\r\n"]
